            "updated_at": "2026-10-04T22:49:10.000000Z"
        },
        {
            "id": 11519,
            "question_id": 23694,
            "provider": "chatgpt",
            "locale": "uk",
            "hint": "Лексична основа: save — відкладати гроші. Умова описує процес до минулого моменту, а не лише завершений результат. Збережи причину, протиставлення або часовий зв’язок, названі в умові.",
            "created_at": "2026-10-04T22:49:10.000000Z",
            "updated_at": "2026-10-04T22:49:10.000000Z"
        },
        {
            "id": 11520,
            "question_id": 23694,
            "provider": "compose_prompt",
            "locale": "en",
            "hint": "Use the past perfect continuous for the earlier process. Start with the main-clause subject; do not move time or reason phrases to the front. Describe Tom's ongoing savings for a bicycle before his birthday.",
            "created_at": "2026-10-04T22:49:10.000000Z",
            "updated_at": "2026-10-04T22:49:10.000000Z"
        },
        {
            "id": 11521,
            "question_id": 23694,
            "provider": "chatgpt",
            "locale": "en",
            "hint": "Lexical verb: save. Describe the process leading up to a past point, not merely a finished result. Preserve the stated cause, contrast or time relation.",
            "created_at": "2026-10-04T22:49:10.000000Z",
            "updated_at": "2026-10-04T22:49:10.000000Z"
        },
        {
            "id": 11522,
